<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Moraine Lake</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:269-3: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.999772" lon="-121.663687"><ele>1935.4</ele><name>Dutchman Flat Sno-park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin (OSM way 559496151); confidence: high; pdf_page: 271; book_elev_ft: 6400; quote: map 61: DUTCHMAN FLAT NORDIC SNO-PARK 6400'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.025855" lon="-121.725417"><ele>1663.1</ele><name>Sparks Lake road junction (Forest Road 4600-400)</name><desc>source: OSM junction Cascade Lakes Highway x Forest Road 4600-400 (map dot where the road turns south to Sparks Lake); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 271; quote: descend about 1,000 feet to Sparks Lake in 3.9 miles; map 61: 1.7 + 2.2 to the dot</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.031567" lon="-121.754126"><ele>1665.1</ele><name>Devils Garden (5480')</name><desc>source: OSM highway node 38511935, about 1.4 mi by road west of the 4600-400 junction (map 1.5); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 271; book_elev_ft: 5480; quote: from Sparks Lake go another 1.5 miles on Century Drive. Turn uphill at the Devils Garden</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.040500" lon="-121.750500"><ele>1840.2</ele><name>East foot of the lava flow</name><desc>source: DEM: east foot of the Devils Chain flows (steep rise to the west); confidence: low; pdf_page: 271; quote: ski up the east edge of a large lava flow that shows clearly on the USGS map just east of Devils Hill</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.048500" lon="-121.751500"><ele>1935.0</ele><name>Lava flow east edge, upper</name><desc>source: DEM: east foot of the flow; confidence: low; pdf_page: 271; quote: Climb almost 1,000 feet along the uneven foot of the lava flow</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.054500" lon="-121.752500"><ele>1910.6</ele><name>Saddle at the top of the lower lava flow</name><desc>source: DEM guess, about 1 mi SE of Moraine Lake; confidence: low; pdf_page: 271; quote: to a saddle at the top of the lower lava flow. Ski 1 mile northwest through forest from the saddle</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.061800" lon="-121.762500"><ele>1974.0</ele><name>Moraine Lake (south shore)</name><desc>source: OSM Moraine Lake (way 358719960) south shore; confidence: high; pdf_page: 271; book_elev_ft: 6450; quote: Sitting in a shallow, treeless bowl at 6,450 feet at the very foot of South Sister</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Moraine Lake</name><desc>1. Dutchman Flat Sno-park -&gt; Sparks Lake road junction (Forest Road 4600-400): osm (high), 4.15 mi | 2. Sparks Lake road junction (Forest Road 4600-400) -&gt; Devils Garden (5480'): osm (high), 1.62 mi | 3. Devils Garden (5480') -&gt; East foot of the lava flow: straight (low), 0.64 mi | 4. East foot of the lava flow -&gt; Lava flow east edge, upper: straight (low), 0.55 mi | 5. Lava flow east edge, upper -&gt; Saddle at the top of the lower lava flow: straight (low), 0.42 mi | 6. Saddle at the top of the lower lava flow -&gt; Moraine Lake (south shore): straight (medium), 0.71 mi</desc>
